.com/recipes/recipes.htm\">Traditional Irish Cuisine</a>.  <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2011-01-19</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.irelandby.com/recipes/recipes.htm\">原始內容</a>存檔於2012-08-01）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E6%84%9B%E7%88%BE%E8%98%AD%E9%A3%B2%E9%A3%9F&amp;rft.btitle=Traditional+Irish+Cuisine&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.irelandby.com%2Frecipes%2Frecipes.htm&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%84%9B%E7%88%BE%E8%98%AD%E9%A3%B2%E9%A3%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook\" href=\"https://wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook\">Wikibooks Cookbook</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20080522121956/http://wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173189\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ol,.mw-parser-output .hlist.inline ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-pa